OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey's summer warmest ever
OL,4,Arecorded
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis summer has been the warmest on
OL,7,Frecord, Guernsey Met Office has
OL,8,Fconfirmed.
OL,10,FMeteorologists said June, July and
OL,11,FAugust were all the warmest summer
OL,12,Fmonths recorded in the island since
OL,13,Frecords began in 1843, with an average
OL,14,Ftemperature of 18.9C (66.2F),
OL,15,Fsignificantly higher than the average
OL,16,Ffor these months of 16.2C (61.2F).
OL,18,FGuernsey Met said the hottest day of
OL,19,Fthe summer came on 25 June, when the
OL,20,Ftemperature hit 36.4C (97.5F).
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
